          "jcr:created": "Wed Dec 27 2023 00:59:38 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Charlotte</span> <span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Multi-Use Compression Screws</span></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Options include 3.0mm, 4.3mm, and 7.0mm</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Surgical grade stainless steel&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Designed to minimize head prominence and patient discomfort</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
