          "jcr:created": "Tue Jun 11 2024 19:38:33 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Charlotte</span> <span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Snap-Off Screws</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Screws available in diameters of 2.0mm with 11, 12 and 14mm lengths as well as 2.7mm with 13, 15, and 17mm lengths.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Instrument set includes a shank remover to gently break off the screw shank without loosening the threads in the underlying bone.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
